---
id: org.dxos.spec.code
name: DSL.Code
version: 1.0
extends:
  - org.dxos.spec.core
  - org.dxos.spec.changelog
---

The code dialect: the blocks a software spec is written in. A `feat` states what the code must do
and groups its requirements; types, operations, components, services, capabilities and modules are
what it is built from; a `scenario` checks it. Their links make a spec a UML model: a type composes
the types of its fields and extends its bases, an operation depends on its input and output, a
service composes its operations.

Many specs still declare these blocks in their own appendix. Rule 4 of the core language's Roles and
Links applies: an appendix declaration keeps this dialect's role, and its own links add to these.

## Extensions

| Term         | URI                           |
| ------------ | ----------------------------- |
| `capability` | `org.dxos.mdl.capability@1.0` |
| `component`  | `org.dxos.mdl.component@1.0`  |
| `db`         | `org.dxos.mdl.db@1.0`         |
| `feat`       | `org.dxos.mdl.feat@1.0`       |
| `module`     | `org.dxos.mdl.module@1.0`     |
| `op`         | `org.dxos.mdl.op@1.1`         |
| `scenario`   | `org.dxos.mdl.scenario@1.0`   |
| `service`    | `org.dxos.mdl.service@1.0`    |
| `type`       | `org.dxos.mdl.type@1.0`       |

## Definitions

```mdl
ext feat
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.feat@1.0
  desc: A named feature grouping one or more requirements.
  nesting: self
  inline-prose: true
  role: anchor
  fields:
    desc?: Prose
    req: RequirementList
    depends?: FeatRef[]          # features this one needs first
  links:
    depends: depends-on
```

```mdl
ext type
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.type@1.0
  desc: A named data structure with typed fields and optional literals.
  role: structure
  fields:
    desc?: Prose
    fields?: FieldMap            # a field typed `Ref<X>` points at X; any other names a part
    literals?: UnionList
    extends?: TypeRef[]
    variants?: TypeRef[]         # the types a union is one of
  links:
    extends: extends
    fields: composes
    variants: generalizes
```

```mdl
ext op
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.op@1.1
  desc: A named operation with typed inputs, outputs, and declared errors.
  role: structure
  fields:
    key?: NSID
    desc?: Prose
    input?: FieldMap
    output?: TypeExpr
    errors?: ErrorMap
    effects?: EffectList
    requires?: ServiceList
    note?: Prose
  links:
    errors: depends-on
    input: depends-on
    output: depends-on
    requires: depends-on
```

```mdl
ext component
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.component@1.0
  desc: A UI component with props, internal state, slots, actions, and events.
  role: structure
  fields:
    desc?: Prose
    props?: FieldMap
    state?: FieldMap
    slots?: FieldMap
    actions?: ActionMap
    emits?: EventMap
    layout?: CodeBlock
  links:
    emits: depends-on
    props: depends-on
    slots: aggregates
    state: composes
```

```mdl
ext service
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.service@1.0
  desc: An external or system-level dependency providing named operations.
  role: structure
  fields:
    desc?: Prose
    loading?: eager | lazy
    ops?: OpMap                  # name(params) → ReturnType
    errors?: ErrorMap
    note?: Prose
  links:
    errors: depends-on
    ops: composes
```

```mdl
ext capability
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.capability@1.0
  desc: A typed slot in the app-framework Capability registry; `multi: true` marks a contributable collection.
  role: structure
  fields:
    desc?: Prose
    type: TypeRef
    events?: EventList
    multi?: boolean
  links:
    events: depends-on
    type: references
```

```mdl
ext module
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.module@1.0
  desc: An ESM namespace module, re-exported from index.ts as `export * as <Name>`.
  role: structure
  fields:
    desc?: Prose
    api: ApiMap                  # public members reached as `<Name>.<member>`
  links:
    api: depends-on
```

```mdl
ext db
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.db@1.0
  desc: A store and what it holds.
  role: structure
  fields:
    desc?: Prose
    backend?: Prose
    entities?: TypeRef[]
    queries?: ProseList
    note?: Prose
  links:
    entities: aggregates
```

```mdl
ext scenario
  uri: org.dxos.mdl.scenario@1.0
  desc: An acceptance scenario expressed as given / when / then steps.
  role: verification
  fields:
    covers?: RefList             # the features and requirements it checks
    given?: Step | Step[]
    when?: Step | Step[]
    then: Step | Step[]
    tags?: TagList
  links:
    covers: verifies
```
